{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The first roguelike deckbuilder where your skill is your mana.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Patterns Of The Oak</strong>\u00a0is a deckbuilding roguelike\u00a0with\u00a0<strong>turn-based combat</strong>. Cast spells in powerful combinations to defeat the ruthless invaders and bring back peace to the homeland of the sacred oak groves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-Features-</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No mana limit -\u00a0Cast as many spells as you can by matching their patterns before the timer runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887360/extras/833d4e28af895f15ce002dea7d8e31f3.avif?t=1754261734\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Abilities - Chain together spell abilities to unleash powerful combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887360/extras/e216d0536f8f51749c44b748e8dd9d03.avif?t=1754261734\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain wisdom from the stars -\u00a0Upgrade your spells and improve your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887360/extras/1b07580bb0eb2d555dc787ca655cbb80.avif?t=1754261734\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weaken your enemy - Casting on 'full' nodes on the grid will reduce enemy stats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887360/extras/bc367ead3890f151a5a053ec7a648418.avif?t=1754261734\" /></div></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/ap